@startuml communication_efficiency
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 4
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

|Client Uplink Stage|
start
:Compute Raw Weight Delta $\Delta \mathbf{w}_t^k \in \mathbb{R}^D$ (FP32: 32 bits/param);

partition "Sparsification Pipeline" {
    :Compute Absolute Magnitude $|\Delta \mathbf{w}_t^k|$;
    :Sort magnitudes and determine threshold $\tau$;
    :Generate Binary Mask $\mathbf{m} = \mathbb{I}(|\Delta \mathbf{w}| \ge \tau)$;
    :Retain Top-$K\%$ non-zero coordinates ($1-K\%$ set to 0);
}

partition "Quantization Pipeline" {
    :Compute dynamic scaling factor $s = \frac{\max |\Delta \mathbf{w}|}{2^{b-1} - 1}$;
    :Apply Stochastic Rounding: $q = \text{clip}\left(\left\lfloor \frac{\Delta \mathbf{w}}{s} + \mathbf{u} \right\rceil, -2^{b-1}, 2^{b-1}-1\right)$;
    :Cast to $b$-bit integer (e.g., INT8 / INT4);
}

partition "Transmission" {
    :Pack non-zero values and sparse index coordinates;
    note right
      <b>Bandwidth Reduction:</b>
      FP32 (32 bits) -> INT8 (8 bits) = 4x reduction
      Top-10% Sparsification = 10x reduction
      Combined ~40x uplink reduction
    end note
    :Transmit compressed payload over network channel;
}

|Server Downlink Stage|
:Receive compressed payloads from all active clients $k \in S_t$;

partition "Reconstruction & Aggregation" {
    :Decompress bitstream and unpack indices;
    :Dequantize integers back to float: $\Delta \hat{\mathbf{w}}_t^k = q \cdot s$;
    :Reconstruct full dimension vectors $\Delta \hat{\mathbf{w}}_t^k$;
    :Execute FedAvg Weighted Parameter Aggregation:
    $\mathbf{w}_{t+1} = \mathbf{w}_t + \sum_{k=1}^K \frac{|\mathcal{D}_k|}{|\mathcal{D}|} \Delta \hat{\mathbf{w}}_t^k$;
}

:Broadcast updated global weights $\mathbf{w}_{t+1}$ to clients;
stop

@enduml
